00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,166
What's the best OpusClip alternative for streamers?

2
00:00:04,116 --> 00:00:07,680
For streamers on Kick, Twitch or YouTube, it's ClipMe.

3
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:10,255
OpusClip is great for finished uploads.

4
00:00:10,255 --> 00:00:13,225
ClipMe's engine clips the live stream itself.

5
00:00:14,175 --> 00:00:16,368
OpusClip needs the finished upload.

6
00:00:16,368 --> 00:00:23,071
ClipMe's engine reads the live stream and cuts ranked clips in batches, so clips land during the broadcast.

7
00:00:24,021 --> 00:00:26,800
It scores moments with a multi-signal model.

8
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:30,336
On Kick and Twitch, chat velocity is one of the signals.

9
00:00:31,286 --> 00:00:33,795
There's no per-minute credit meter.

10
00:00:33,795 --> 00:00:35,157
Pricing is per VOD.

11
00:00:35,157 --> 00:00:39,243
Starter is free with a watermark, and Pro is $29 a month.

12
00:00:40,193 --> 00:00:43,682
Compare every OpusClip alternative at clipme.com.

